{"id": "m1793032997952", "ts": "2026-10-26T11:43:17", "source": "manual", "text": "I am running on the model the plan is about: strata.json points at the swift15 IQ3_S pair with --resident-budget-gib 36, and its MCP servers are the tools answering right now. So the live tier is 36 GiB, not the plan's stale 11.25 - and at 1.032 GiB per J-layer the full 36-layer J chain is 37.14 GiB, just over budget: it needs 40 GiB, which the plan's own Phase 2 table already benched at 13.2 tok/s against 10.7 at 36.\n\nAlso: Phase 0 cannot be run from inside this session. Running the existing engine cold/warm/pinned restarts the host, which takes this process with it. It has to be run by the user, or from a separate process.", "vec": [-0.078387, -0.08534, 0.046971, 0.008072, 0.059688, 0.029653, -0.052869, -0.024591, -0.019179, -0.029781, 0.027858, -0.014549, -0.003718, 0.034577, 0.055597, 0.033527, -0.015808, -0.063851, 0.029903, 0.027357, 0.050195, -0.038616, -0.01906, -0.017139, 0.007901, 0.055992, -0.007021, -0.030347, -0.016631, -0.232328, 0.00859, -0.081002, 0.001385, 0.001718, -0.033422, 0.034751, -0.030166, 0.031861, 0.014118, 0.085999, -0.002699, 0.050661, -0.046119, -0.032463, -0.018053, -0.042414, -0.033533, 0.068545, -0.012384, -0.013339, 0.005834, -0.074894, -0.03967, 0.027899, 0.036841, 0.059594, 0.031714, -0.006835, 0.032866, 0.031777, -0.002807, 0.017168, -0.123897, 0.042212, 0.023406, 0.045676, -0.03055, -0.009903, -0.013956, 0.07389, 0.030219, 0.019943, 0.016207, 0.023603, -0.02622, -0.061808, 0.028574, 0.106046, 0.063165, -0.009583, -0.032347, 0.008137, 0.006523, 0.018926, -0.008849, -0.045437, 0.010934, -0.009191, 0.00955, 0.002408, 0.05632, -0.065304, 0.06065, -0.039567, -0.030736, 0.027708, -0.001008, 0.013191, -0.005834, 0.403423, 0.022007, 0.016854, 0.00952, 0.086178, 0.00859, -0.034434, -0.02079, 0.038209, 0.05485, 0.001776, -0.004909, -0.010996, 0.004874, -0.023417, 0.031913, -0.023655, -0.012029, -0.012675, -0.050504, -0.006112, 0.041909, 0.041362, 0.027368